    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "So if I increase the lecithin concentration to improve that interfacial coverage, do you think I'll run into issues with the flavor profile or texture? Or is there a risk that the increased surfactant load might actually destabilize the emulsion via some other mechanism, like micelle formation interfering with the droplet stability?",
